1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:06,570
Telefoning jiringlaganda sen telefonni emas, telefon seni boshqaradi.

2
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:09,540
Usta, bir daqiqa, xabar keldi!

3
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,260
Diyor, eshit.

4
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:15,050
2006-yil, Amerika.

5
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:19,090
Bir muhandis cheksiz aylantirishni o'ylab topdi:

6
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:22,400
sahifa tugamaydi, pastga tushaverasan.

7
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:26,150
Sahifa tugasa, to'xtaysan.

8
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:29,050
Tugamasa, to'xtamaysan.

9
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:33,840
Keyinchalik u shu ixtirosidan afsuslanishini ochiq aytdi.

10
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:37,010
Ilovalar bizni ataylab ushlab turadimi?!

11
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:42,810
Bir tadqiqotga ko'ra, o'rtacha foydalanuvchi kuniga qirq oltitaga yaqin bildirishnoma oladi.

12
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:47,060
Ilovalar sening e'tiboring bilan pul topadi:

13
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:51,290
qancha uzoq qarasang, shuncha ko'p reklama ko'rsatiladi.

14
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:52,950
Uchta qoida.

15
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:55,500
Keraksiz bildirishnomani o'chir.

16
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,360
Kechasi tinch rejimni yoq.

17
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:59,910
Ilovani ochishdan oldin so'ra:

18
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:01,070
nega ochyapman?

19
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:03,940
Telefon jim, men tinch!

20
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:10,930
Ular senga ilovani emas, «o'tkazib yuboraman» degan qo'rquvni sotadi.

21
00:01:10,930 --> 00:01:11,970
Har gal so'ra:

22
00:01:11,970 --> 00:01:14,050
bundan kim foyda ko'radi?

23
00:01:14,550 --> 00:01:20,250
Qaysi bildirishnomani o'chirishni bilmasangiz, ilova nomini botimizga yozing:

24
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:21,270
@sahiychishopbot.

25
00:01:21,270 --> 00:01:23,110
Bosqichma-bosqich o'rgatadi.

